**Summary:**

- **9 strategies passed** with no issues.
- **cursor_opus46max_109** had 1 bug fixed: the "skip recent anomaly" loop used `range(start, i)` which always included bar `i-1` — the very bar that triggered `confirmed[i] = True` (because `arrival_ratio[i-1] > arr_thresh` is the confirmation condition). This caused every signal to be cancelled, resulting in 0 entries. Fixed by changing to `range(start, i-1)` to exclude the triggering bar, restoring 14 long and 19 short signals.
